#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- There are several ways to run workloads, depending on your needs: job mode, session mode, and batch mode. Learn how to work with session mode and batch mode in the [execution modes topic](/guides/execution-modes-rest-api). Note that Open Plan users cannot submit session jobs.\n"
"- Learn how to [initialize your account](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) with REST API.\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Learn how to transpile locally in the [Transpile](/guides/transpile) section.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"- Ada beberapa cara untuk menjalankan beban kerja, tergantung kebutuhanmu: mode job, mode sesi, dan mode batch. Pelajari cara bekerja dengan mode sesi dan mode batch di [topik mode eksekusi](/guides/execution-modes-rest-api). Perhatikan bahwa pengguna Open Plan tidak dapat mengirimkan job sesi.\n"
"- Pelajari cara [menginisialisasi akunmu](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) dengan REST API.\n"
"- Berlatih dengan primitif dengan mengerjakan [pelajaran Cost function](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) di IBM Quantum Learning.\n"
"- Pelajari cara transpile secara lokal di bagian [Transpile](/guides/transpile).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
